codex
The strengthened specification also proves as `#Top`: one claim verifies module loading, and the second proves the function for arbitrary strings and arbitrary caller continuations/environments. The full reproducibility script is still running its concrete Haskell-backend executions; that backend is slower because the explicit membership semantics branches over the fixed character set, but it is making progress.
